{% extends "layout.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<div class="wrap prose-page">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <h1 class="page-title">About {{ store.name }}</h1>
    <p class="sub">One maker, a small print setup in {{ store.makerLocation }}, and zero dropshipping.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="prose-card">
    <h2>Built one print at a time</h2>
    <p>
      {{ store.name }} started out of building cosplay props from scratch and never putting the printers away. Every figurine, mask, buckle, and desk piece in the shop is sliced, printed, cleaned, and packed by hand.
    </p>
    <p>
      Because nothing sits in a warehouse, you can pick raw kits to finish yourself or hand-painted pieces ready to display or wear out of the box.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="prose-card">
    <h2>Materials &amp; quality</h2>
    <p>
      Wearable masks and visors use tough PLA+ or PETG tuned for strength without feeling heavy on your face. Figurines and fine armor hardware use high-detail cured resin so crisp edges survive display shelves and travel.
    </p>
  </div>
</div>
{% endblock %}
